{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24622","headline":"履道西门二首 一 · 白居易","name":"履道西门二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"履道西门有弊居，池塘竹树遶君庐。\n豪华肥壮虽无分，饱暖安闲即有余。\n行竈朝香炊早饭，小园春暖掇新蔬。\n夷齐黄绮夸芝蕨，比我盘飧恐不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}